%% Processing flow for one document, from upload to safe download.
flowchart TD
    A([User drops a PDF or image]) --> P0[User types My details for this session<br/>kept in memory only, optional]
    P0 --> B[Load file in memory<br/>no upload]
    B --> C[Render each page with PDF.js]
    C --> D{Page has a usable<br/>text layer?}
    D -- yes --> E[Extract words + coordinates<br/>fix right-to-left order]
    D -- "no (scan, photo, garbled text)" --> F[OCR page with Tesseract.js<br/>words + coordinates]
    E --> N0[Normalise text<br/>text stream + digits-only stream, mapped to boxes]
    F --> N0

    N0 --> L1[Layer 1: match My details<br/>variants of each value, exact on text pages,<br/>fuzzy on OCR pages]
    N0 --> L2[Layer 2: Also found<br/>name model, patterns, field labels,<br/>barcodes, metadata]

    L1 --> H[Merge findings<br/>same value gets the same label everywhere]
    L2 --> H

    H --> I[Review screen<br/>Your details: hidden by default<br/>Also found: suggestions awaiting a decision]
    I --> J{User action}
    J -- "hide / keep / replace" --> I
    J -- "hide everywhere: add to session details,<br/>re-run matcher" --> I
    J -- "ignore for this session" --> I
    J -- "manual box (signature, stamp, photo)" --> I
    J -- export --> W{Undecided<br/>suggestions left?}
    W -- "yes: warn user" --> I
    W -- no --> K{Output mode}

    K -- Anonymous --> L[Black boxes]
    K -- Template --> M["Labelled placeholders<br/>[FULL NAME], [ID NUMBER], [BANK ACCOUNT]"]

    L --> N[Paint redactions into page pixels<br/>original content under the box is destroyed]
    M --> N
    N --> O[Rebuild a new PDF from the flattened pages<br/>no metadata, attachments, form data or history]
    O --> Q1[Verify: extract text from the output<br/>and search for every hidden value]
    Q1 --> Q{Clean?}
    Q -- no --> I
    Q -- yes --> R([Download anonymised PDF])
    R --> Z([Tab closed: document and details erased])
